{"id":"forecast-08","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-08/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":464.67,"segments":[{"start":0.34,"end":7.7,"text":"Part 3. You will hear two business students called Janet and Michael discussing their research","words":[["Part",0.34,0.88],["3.",0.88,1.28],["You",2.14,2.58],["will",2.58,2.74],["hear",2.74,2.98],["two",2.98,3.32],["business",3.32,3.7],["students",3.7,4.24],["called",4.24,4.76],["Janet",4.76,5.16],["and",5.16,5.5],["Michael",5.5,5.84],["discussing",5.84,6.8],["their",6.8,7.24],["research",7.24,7.7]]},{"start":7.7,"end":14.14,"text":"into the marketing of different kinds of shampoo. First, you have some time to look at questions","words":[["into",7.7,7.98],["the",7.98,8.16],["marketing",8.16,8.52],["of",8.52,8.86],["different",8.86,9.18],["kinds",9.18,9.72],["of",9.72,9.88],["shampoo.",9.88,10.32],["First,",11.58,12.28],["you",12.48,12.54],["have",12.54,12.72],["some",12.72,12.9],["time",12.9,13.3],["to",13.3,13.56],["look",13.56,13.68],["at",13.68,13.82],["questions",13.82,14.14]]},{"start":14.14,"end":65.69,"text":"21 to 26. Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 26.","words":[["21",14.14,14.94],["to",14.94,15.24],["26.",15.24,15.78],["Now",61.43,61.79],["listen",61.79,62.13],["carefully",62.13,62.61],["and",62.61,63.23],["answer",63.23,63.57],["questions",63.57,63.99],["21",63.99,64.83],["to",64.83,65.11],["26.",65.11,65.69]]},{"start":69.0,"end":73.02,"text":"Hi, Janet. How are you getting on with the shampoo marketing project?","words":[["Hi,",69.0,69.62],["Janet.",69.76,69.98],["How",70.54,70.76],["are",70.76,70.86],["you",70.86,70.96],["getting",70.96,71.14],["on",71.14,71.38],["with",71.38,71.54],["the",71.54,71.7],["shampoo",71.7,71.98],["marketing",71.98,72.48],["project?",72.48,73.02]]},{"start":73.02,"end":80.0,"text":"Hi, Michael. It's interesting. I've read how shampoo marketing has developed over the last","words":[["Hi,",73.02,74.12],["Michael.",74.24,74.46],["It's",75.04,75.54],["interesting.",75.54,76.14],["I've",76.8,77.22],["read",77.22,77.38],["how",77.38,77.64],["shampoo",77.64,78.08],["marketing",78.08,78.54],["has",78.54,78.88],["developed",78.88,79.24],["over",79.24,79.58],["the",79.58,79.72],["last",79.72,80.0]]},{"start":80.0,"end":80.72,"text":"hundred years.","words":[["hundred",80.0,80.32],["years.",80.32,80.72]]},{"start":81.36,"end":83.76,"text":"Oh, I didn't think we needed to do that.","words":[["Oh,",81.36,81.82],["I",81.98,82.42],["didn't",82.42,82.6],["think",82.6,82.8],["we",82.8,82.94],["needed",82.94,83.14],["to",83.14,83.34],["do",83.34,83.48],["that.",83.48,83.76]]},{"start":84.54,"end":91.06,"text":"True, but I'm interested anyway. Basically, what was once sold as an economical way of","words":[["True,",84.54,85.02],["but",85.26,85.42],["I'm",85.42,85.72],["interested",85.72,86.1],["anyway.",86.1,86.52],["Basically,",87.2,87.64],["what",88.26,88.48],["was",88.48,88.7],["once",88.7,89.04],["sold",89.04,89.5],["as",89.5,89.82],["an",89.82,89.98],["economical",89.98,90.46],["way",90.46,90.9],["of",90.9,91.06]]},{"start":91.06,"end":94.66,"text":"getting your hair clean has evolved into a beauty product.","words":[["getting",91.06,91.26],["your",91.26,91.48],["hair",91.48,91.74],["clean",91.74,92.14],["has",92.14,92.7],["evolved",92.7,93.16],["into",93.16,93.58],["a",93.58,93.88],["beauty",93.88,94.1],["product.",94.1,94.66]]},{"start":94.92,"end":95.26,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",94.92,95.26]]},{"start":95.7,"end":102.24,"text":"And shampoo's interesting, because it's a key influence in how we see ourselves. You've","words":[["And",95.7,96.1],["shampoo's",96.1,96.96],["interesting,",96.96,97.54],["because",97.72,98.48],["it's",98.48,98.84],["a",98.84,98.92],["key",98.92,99.16],["influence",99.16,99.7],["in",99.7,100.02],["how",100.02,100.24],["we",100.24,100.42],["see",100.42,100.66],["ourselves.",100.66,101.18],["You've",101.74,102.24]]},{"start":102.24,"end":103.66,"text":"heard of bad hair days.","words":[["heard",102.24,102.4],["of",102.4,102.58],["bad",102.58,103.06],["hair",103.06,103.3],["days.",103.3,103.66]]},{"start":104.36,"end":108.44,"text":"When your hair looks bad, maybe you didn't wash it and you feel bad about it?","words":[["When",104.36,104.62],["your",104.62,104.88],["hair",104.88,105.1],["looks",105.1,105.3],["bad,",105.3,105.66],["maybe",106.1,106.34],["you",106.34,106.48],["didn't",106.48,106.62],["wash",106.62,106.98],["it",106.98,107.18],["and",107.18,107.32],["you",107.32,107.46],["feel",107.46,107.7],["bad",107.7,108.02],["about",108.02,108.2],["it?",108.2,108.44]]},{"start":109.18,"end":110.44,"text":"Heard of them, yes.","words":[["Heard",109.18,109.64],["of",109.64,109.76],["them,",109.76,110.04],["yes.",110.22,110.44]]},{"start":111.02,"end":111.52,"text":"Had one?","words":[["Had",111.02,111.32],["one?",111.32,111.52]]},{"start":112.06,"end":112.44,"text":"No.","words":[["No.",112.06,112.44]]},{"start":113.28,"end":114.12,"text":"Don't think they're real.","words":[["Don't",113.28,113.5],["think",113.5,113.62],["they're",113.62,113.82],["real.",113.82,114.12]]},{"start":114.74,"end":115.74,"text":"Bad hair days?","words":[["Bad",114.74,115.08],["hair",115.08,115.34],["days?",115.34,115.74]]},{"start":115.96,"end":116.46,"text":"Come on.","words":[["Come",115.96,116.18],["on.",116.18,116.46]]},{"start":116.9,"end":121.94,"text":"Well, whatever you want to call them, that's not what research from Yale is suggesting.","words":[["Well,",116.9,117.26],["whatever",117.38,117.56],["you",117.56,117.8],["want",117.8,117.96],["to",117.96,118.14],["call",118.14,118.38],["them,",118.38,118.64],["that's",119.06,119.46],["not",119.46,119.68],["what",119.68,119.92],["research",119.92,120.4],["from",120.4,120.8],["Yale",120.8,121.04],["is",121.04,121.42],["suggesting.",121.42,121.94]]},{"start":122.6,"end":127.26,"text":"They're not just imagined, and both sexes are equally affected by them.","words":[["They're",122.6,123.0],["not",123.0,123.26],["just",123.26,123.52],["imagined,",123.52,124.0],["and",124.62,124.86],["both",124.86,125.1],["sexes",125.1,125.68],["are",125.68,125.92],["equally",125.92,126.32],["affected",126.32,126.78],["by",126.78,127.06],["them.",127.06,127.26]]},{"start":127.26,"end":131.98,"text":"And when they happen, people tend to perform and feel worse than usual.","words":[["And",127.26,128.06],["when",128.06,128.2],["they",128.2,128.4],["happen,",128.4,128.74],["people",129.22,129.5],["tend",129.5,129.8],["to",129.8,129.96],["perform",129.96,130.4],["and",130.4,130.88],["feel",130.88,131.14],["worse",131.14,131.46],["than",131.46,131.66],["usual.",131.66,131.98]]},{"start":132.8,"end":133.22,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",132.8,133.22]]},{"start":133.92,"end":139.7,"text":"And I've been reading about shampoo ingredients, chemicals like sodium laurel sulfate,","words":[["And",133.92,134.28],["I've",134.28,134.5],["been",134.5,134.66],["reading",134.66,135.0],["about",135.0,135.3],["shampoo",135.3,135.88],["ingredients,",135.88,136.5],["chemicals",136.98,137.44],["like",137.44,137.92],["sodium",137.92,138.42],["laurel",138.42,138.96],["sulfate,",138.96,139.7]]},{"start":140.5,"end":141.86,"text":"Methyl chloride.","words":[["Methyl",140.5,141.18],["chloride.",141.18,141.86]]},{"start":142.86,"end":148.86,"text":"Many of the manufacturers tend to use these, or others like them, though they keep it quiet.","words":[["Many",142.86,143.2],["of",143.2,143.38],["the",143.38,143.48],["manufacturers",143.48,144.14],["tend",144.14,144.9],["to",144.9,145.3],["use",145.3,145.6],["these,",145.6,145.92],["or",146.22,146.46],["others",146.46,146.82],["like",146.82,147.16],["them,",147.16,147.46],["though",147.72,147.96],["they",147.96,148.1],["keep",148.1,148.36],["it",148.36,148.48],["quiet.",148.48,148.86]]},{"start":149.24,"end":149.5,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",149.24,149.5]]},{"start":149.88,"end":153.94,"text":"When it comes to the product packaging, they're strangely silent about it.","words":[["When",149.88,150.02],["it",150.02,150.14],["comes",150.14,150.38],["to",150.38,150.56],["the",150.56,150.66],["product",150.66,151.02],["packaging,",151.02,151.6],["they're",152.04,152.3],["strangely",152.3,152.82],["silent",152.82,153.36],["about",153.36,153.68],["it.",153.68,153.94]]},{"start":153.94,"end":159.1,"text":"Another area it would be interesting to investigate is the labeling on bottles.","words":[["Another",153.94,154.6],["area",154.6,155.14],["it",155.14,155.42],["would",155.42,155.52],["be",155.52,155.68],["interesting",155.68,156.18],["to",156.18,156.52],["investigate",156.52,157.06],["is",157.06,157.78],["the",157.78,157.98],["labeling",157.98,158.34],["on",158.34,158.68],["bottles.",158.68,159.1]]},{"start":159.78,"end":167.76,"text":"Apparently printing directly onto the bottles costs about 50% less than sticking a printed label on","words":[["Apparently",159.78,160.56],["printing",160.56,161.54],["directly",161.54,162.04],["onto",162.04,162.62],["the",162.62,162.84],["bottles",162.84,163.24],["costs",163.24,163.94],["about",163.94,164.26],["50",164.26,164.7],["%",164.7,165.08],["less",165.08,165.48],["than",165.48,166.06],["sticking",166.06,166.5],["a",166.5,166.78],["printed",166.78,167.1],["label",167.1,167.48],["on",167.48,167.76]]},{"start":167.76,"end":169.8,"text":"because it's a much quicker process.","words":[["because",167.76,168.3],["it's",168.3,168.58],["a",168.58,168.68],["much",168.68,168.9],["quicker",168.9,169.2],["process.",169.2,169.8]]},{"start":170.58,"end":177.9,"text":"But manufacturers are lukewarm about this because it doesn't enhance the visual impact of the bottle.","words":[["But",170.58,170.98],["manufacturers",170.98,172.04],["are",172.04,172.82],["lukewarm",172.82,173.52],["about",173.52,173.82],["this",173.82,174.2],["because",174.2,174.6],["it",174.6,174.8],["doesn't",174.8,175.2],["enhance",175.2,175.68],["the",175.68,176.0],["visual",176.0,176.4],["impact",176.4,176.86],["of",176.86,177.34],["the",177.34,177.52],["bottle.",177.52,177.9]]},{"start":178.46,"end":180.5,"text":"It comes across as a bit cheap.","words":[["It",178.46,178.78],["comes",178.78,179.12],["across",179.12,179.48],["as",179.48,179.96],["a",179.96,180.06],["bit",180.06,180.2],["cheap.",180.2,180.5]]},{"start":180.5,"end":183.92,"text":"Hmm, we need to think about environmental issues.","words":[["Hmm,",180.5,181.2],["we",181.68,182.1],["need",182.1,182.26],["to",182.26,182.4],["think",182.4,182.6],["about",182.6,182.84],["environmental",182.84,183.32],["issues.",183.32,183.92]]},{"start":184.6,"end":188.54,"text":"I was surprised how little recycled plastic goes into the bottles.","words":[["I",184.6,184.96],["was",184.96,185.08],["surprised",185.08,185.42],["how",185.42,185.7],["little",185.7,186.06],["recycled",186.06,186.62],["plastic",186.62,187.32],["goes",187.32,187.84],["into",187.84,188.06],["the",188.06,188.2],["bottles.",188.2,188.54]]},{"start":189.08,"end":194.28,"text":"I think it's because light-colored plastic is more difficult to make from recycled stuff.","words":[["I",189.08,189.42],["think",189.42,189.6],["it's",189.6,189.86],["because",189.86,190.24],["light",190.24,190.74],["-colored",190.74,191.1],["plastic",191.1,191.68],["is",191.68,191.9],["more",191.9,192.08],["difficult",192.08,192.48],["to",192.48,192.84],["make",192.84,193.02],["from",193.02,193.26],["recycled",193.26,193.7],["stuff.",193.7,194.28]]},{"start":194.94,"end":200.3,"text":"Yeah, but manufacturers can make their packaging more environmentally friendly just by making","words":[["Yeah,",194.94,195.26],["but",195.42,195.66],["manufacturers",195.66,196.24],["can",196.24,196.74],["make",196.74,196.92],["their",196.92,197.1],["packaging",197.1,197.52],["more",197.52,197.84],["environmentally",197.84,198.54],["friendly",198.54,199.16],["just",199.16,199.74],["by",199.74,199.96],["making",199.96,200.3]]},{"start":200.3,"end":201.12,"text":"it less heavy.","words":[["it",200.3,200.46],["less",200.46,200.66],["heavy.",200.66,201.12]]},{"start":201.74,"end":205.72,"text":"I'd like to find out whether some of them actually do when we do the research.","words":[["I'd",201.74,202.24],["like",202.24,202.36],["to",202.36,202.52],["find",202.52,202.78],["out",202.78,203.02],["whether",203.02,203.26],["some",203.26,203.62],["of",203.62,203.74],["them",203.74,203.86],["actually",203.86,204.2],["do",204.2,204.62],["when",204.62,204.92],["we",204.92,205.04],["do",205.04,205.18],["the",205.18,205.32],["research.",205.32,205.72]]},{"start":206.2,"end":207.96,"text":"Yes, that's worth looking into.","words":[["Yes,",206.2,206.54],["that's",206.7,206.98],["worth",206.98,207.18],["looking",207.18,207.52],["into.",207.52,207.96]]},{"start":207.96,"end":213.28,"text":"Thinking about you as a customer, what's important when choosing shampoo?","words":[["Thinking",207.96,209.02],["about",209.02,209.42],["you",209.42,209.62],["as",209.62,209.76],["a",209.76,209.88],["customer,",209.88,210.3],["what's",210.9,211.24],["important",211.24,211.72],["when",211.72,212.28],["choosing",212.28,212.74],["shampoo?",212.74,213.28]]},{"start":214.52,"end":216.8,"text":"I'm always wary of special offers.","words":[["I'm",214.52,215.16],["always",215.16,215.58],["wary",215.58,215.92],["of",215.92,216.08],["special",216.08,216.38],["offers.",216.38,216.8]]},{"start":217.54,"end":222.0,"text":"When something's flagged as being half price, it rarely is really.","words":[["When",217.54,217.74],["something's",217.74,218.2],["flagged",218.2,218.76],["as",218.76,218.86],["being",218.86,219.14],["half",219.14,219.62],["price,",219.62,220.0],["it",220.76,220.88],["rarely",220.88,221.2],["is",221.2,221.64],["really.",221.64,222.0]]},{"start":222.96,"end":227.98,"text":"But if there's a make I've never seen before, I'm usually up for giving it a go","words":[["But",222.96,223.22],["if",223.22,223.44],["there's",223.44,224.08],["a",224.08,224.24],["make",224.24,224.52],["I've",224.52,224.9],["never",224.9,225.14],["seen",225.14,225.44],["before,",225.44,225.78],["I'm",226.22,226.48],["usually",226.48,226.82],["up",226.82,227.04],["for",227.04,227.14],["giving",227.14,227.36],["it",227.36,227.54],["a",227.54,227.7],["go",227.7,227.98]]},{"start":227.98,"end":231.76,"text":"rather than sticking to one or two favorite brands all my life.","words":[["rather",227.98,228.62],["than",228.62,228.86],["sticking",228.86,229.2],["to",229.2,229.44],["one",229.44,229.7],["or",229.7,229.8],["two",229.8,230.08],["favorite",230.08,230.48],["brands",230.48,231.0],["all",231.0,231.22],["my",231.22,231.38],["life.",231.38,231.76]]},{"start":232.22,"end":232.82,"text":"Interesting.","words":[["Interesting.",232.22,232.82]]},{"start":232.82,"end":242.21,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 27","words":[["Before",232.82,234.2],["you",236.89,237.23],["hear",237.23,237.51],["the",237.51,237.73],["rest",237.73,237.99],["of",237.99,238.11],["the",238.11,238.17],["discussion,",238.17,238.57],["you",238.95,239.47],["have",239.47,239.73],["some",239.73,239.93],["time",239.93,240.39],["to",240.39,240.67],["look",240.67,240.83],["at",240.83,240.95],["questions",240.95,241.33],["27",241.33,242.21]]},{"start":242.21,"end":242.87,"text":"to 30.","words":[["to",242.21,242.51],["30.",242.51,242.87]]},{"start":263.11,"end":266.67,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 27 to 30.","words":[["Now",263.11,263.51],["listen",263.51,263.85],["and",263.85,264.23],["answer",264.23,264.63],["questions",264.63,265.05],["27",265.05,265.97],["to",265.97,266.27],["30.",266.27,266.67]]},{"start":270.12,"end":278.2,"text":"Shall we discuss some of these shampoo advertisements then, and try and identify what sort of psychological","words":[["Shall",270.12,270.56],["we",270.56,270.74],["discuss",270.74,271.16],["some",271.16,271.56],["of",271.56,271.7],["these",271.7,271.9],["shampoo",271.9,272.44],["advertisements",272.44,273.3],["then,",273.3,273.78],["and",274.26,274.82],["try",274.82,275.28],["and",275.28,275.54],["identify",275.54,276.18],["what",276.18,276.92],["sort",276.92,277.36],["of",277.36,277.62],["psychological",277.62,278.2]]},{"start":278.2,"end":281.3,"text":"response each one is trying to get from the viewer?","words":[["response",278.2,279.16],["each",279.16,279.56],["one",279.56,279.82],["is",279.82,280.06],["trying",280.06,280.32],["to",280.32,280.48],["get",280.48,280.64],["from",280.64,280.88],["the",280.88,281.04],["viewer?",281.04,281.3]]},{"start":281.84,"end":282.26,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",281.84,282.26]]},{"start":282.92,"end":284.08,"text":"What about Zing?","words":[["What",282.92,283.12],["about",283.12,283.54],["Zing?",283.54,284.08]]},{"start":284.08,"end":288.96,"text":"Well, it'd probably appeal equally to men and women.","words":[["Well,",284.08,285.0],["it'd",285.5,285.88],["probably",285.88,286.72],["appeal",286.72,287.38],["equally",287.38,287.94],["to",287.94,288.22],["men",288.22,288.48],["and",288.48,288.62],["women.",288.62,288.96]]},{"start":289.58,"end":295.82,"text":"In the ad, we see this happy family, lovely home, healthy, good-looking children.","words":[["In",289.58,289.9],["the",289.9,290.04],["ad,",290.04,290.48],["we",290.64,290.72],["see",290.72,291.0],["this",291.0,291.32],["happy",291.32,291.76],["family,",291.76,292.24],["lovely",292.74,293.08],["home,",293.08,293.72],["healthy,",294.1,294.5],["good",294.74,294.86],["-looking",294.86,295.06],["children.",295.06,295.82]]},{"start":296.3,"end":297.58,"text":"With clean hair.","words":[["With",296.3,296.58],["clean",296.58,297.14],["hair.",297.14,297.58]]},{"start":298.04,"end":299.44,"text":"Obviously, yes.","words":[["Obviously,",298.04,298.7],["yes.",298.96,299.44]]},{"start":300.22,"end":307.44,"text":"And I think we're supposed to watch the ad and think, wow, if only my life was like","words":[["And",300.22,300.46],["I",300.46,300.82],["think",300.82,301.26],["we're",301.26,301.8],["supposed",301.8,302.08],["to",302.08,302.46],["watch",302.46,302.78],["the",302.78,303.1],["ad",303.1,303.62],["and",303.62,304.0],["think,",304.0,304.4],["wow,",305.04,305.52],["if",305.76,305.96],["only",305.96,306.3],["my",306.3,306.62],["life",306.62,307.0],["was",307.0,307.18],["like",307.18,307.44]]},{"start":307.44,"end":307.8,"text":"that.","words":[["that.",307.44,307.8]]},{"start":308.08,"end":309.46,"text":"Yeah, I know what you mean.","words":[["Yeah,",308.08,308.4],["I",308.64,308.84],["know",308.84,309.02],["what",309.02,309.14],["you",309.14,309.24],["mean.",309.24,309.46]]},{"start":309.46,"end":314.82,"text":"I mean, I think the advertisers want the viewers to almost wish they were the people in the","words":[["I",309.46,309.56],["mean,",309.56,309.56],["I",310.02,310.72],["think",310.72,310.88],["the",310.88,311.04],["advertisers",311.04,311.58],["want",311.58,311.98],["the",311.98,312.16],["viewers",312.16,312.46],["to",312.46,312.74],["almost",312.74,313.14],["wish",313.14,313.58],["they",313.58,313.92],["were",313.92,314.06],["the",314.06,314.18],["people",314.18,314.46],["in",314.46,314.66],["the",314.66,314.82]]},{"start":314.82,"end":315.12,"text":"ad.","words":[["ad.",314.82,315.12]]},{"start":315.48,"end":315.76,"text":"Sure.","words":[["Sure.",315.48,315.76]]},{"start":316.22,"end":318.64,"text":"I mean, that's very common in advertising.","words":[["I",316.22,316.44],["mean,",316.44,316.6],["that's",316.86,317.16],["very",317.16,317.38],["common",317.38,317.78],["in",317.78,318.06],["advertising.",318.06,318.64]]},{"start":319.02,"end":320.48,"text":"But not universal.","words":[["But",319.02,319.46],["not",319.46,319.96],["universal.",319.96,320.48]]},{"start":320.88,"end":327.22,"text":"You know that ad for Splash Shampoo that lasts about five minutes and where there's a story?","words":[["You",320.88,321.16],["know",321.16,322.06],["that",322.06,322.28],["ad",322.28,322.52],["for",322.52,322.72],["Splash",322.72,323.24],["Shampoo",323.24,323.62],["that",323.62,323.94],["lasts",323.94,324.42],["about",324.42,324.78],["five",324.78,325.16],["minutes",325.16,325.52],["and",325.52,326.38],["where",326.38,326.58],["there's",326.58,326.78],["a",326.78,326.88],["story?",326.88,327.22]]},{"start":327.8,"end":328.44,"text":"Oh yes.","words":[["Oh",327.8,328.12],["yes.",328.12,328.44]]},{"start":329.24,"end":334.82,"text":"The commercial about the couple and all through the commercial, it's not clear if they're","words":[["The",329.24,329.62],["commercial",329.62,330.14],["about",330.14,330.64],["the",330.64,330.82],["couple",330.82,331.08],["and",331.08,332.0],["all",332.0,332.3],["through",332.3,332.56],["the",332.56,332.72],["commercial,",332.72,333.12],["it's",333.46,333.58],["not",333.58,333.84],["clear",333.84,334.32],["if",334.32,334.66],["they're",334.66,334.82]]},{"start":334.82,"end":336.4,"text":"going to break up or stay together.","words":[["going",334.82,334.96],["to",334.96,335.12],["break",335.12,335.32],["up",335.32,335.6],["or",335.6,335.78],["stay",335.78,336.06],["together.",336.06,336.4]]},{"start":336.72,"end":337.34,"text":"Exactly.","words":[["Exactly.",336.72,337.34]]},{"start":337.96,"end":341.22,"text":"Well, I think the marketing's been done very cleverly there.","words":[["Well,",337.96,338.44],["I",338.48,338.6],["think",338.6,338.76],["the",338.76,338.92],["marketing's",338.92,339.48],["been",339.48,339.64],["done",339.64,339.84],["very",339.84,340.3],["cleverly",340.3,340.96],["there.",340.96,341.22]]},{"start":341.78,"end":346.3,"text":"I don't think we're supposed to want to be the characters in the commercial, but we're","words":[["I",341.78,342.26],["don't",342.26,342.38],["think",342.38,342.5],["we're",342.5,342.68],["supposed",342.68,342.94],["to",342.94,343.26],["want",343.26,343.44],["to",343.44,343.66],["be",343.66,343.96],["the",343.96,344.12],["characters",344.12,344.58],["in",344.58,344.82],["the",344.82,344.9],["commercial,",344.9,345.38],["but",345.68,346.0],["we're",346.0,346.3]]},{"start":346.3,"end":347.8,"text":"supposed to get to know them a bit.","words":[["supposed",346.3,346.56],["to",346.56,346.86],["get",346.86,346.98],["to",346.98,347.14],["know",347.14,347.36],["them",347.36,347.54],["a",347.54,347.7],["bit.",347.7,347.8]]},{"start":348.18,"end":350.94,"text":"Yes, well, I thought the story was effective.","words":[["Yes,",348.18,348.66],["well,",348.96,349.14],["I",349.28,349.48],["thought",349.48,349.72],["the",349.72,349.92],["story",349.92,350.28],["was",350.28,350.48],["effective.",350.48,350.94]]},{"start":351.68,"end":355.46,"text":"You're glad to learn when it's over that they're obviously going to stay together.","words":[["You're",351.68,351.96],["glad",351.96,352.22],["to",352.22,352.48],["learn",352.48,352.74],["when",352.74,352.9],["it's",352.9,353.14],["over",353.14,353.46],["that",353.46,353.98],["they're",353.98,354.2],["obviously",354.2,354.58],["going",354.58,354.78],["to",354.78,354.92],["stay",354.92,355.1],["together.",355.1,355.46]]},{"start":355.92,"end":360.82,"text":"But I think the role of the shampoo in the story was a bit thin, to say the least.","words":[["But",355.92,356.4],["I",356.4,356.86],["think",356.86,357.12],["the",357.12,357.36],["role",357.36,357.54],["of",357.54,357.7],["the",357.7,357.84],["shampoo",357.84,358.24],["in",358.24,358.52],["the",358.52,358.62],["story",358.62,358.94],["was",358.94,359.14],["a",359.14,359.28],["bit",359.28,359.38],["thin,",359.38,359.78],["to",359.92,360.14],["say",360.14,360.34],["the",360.34,360.48],["least.",360.48,360.82]]},{"start":361.3,"end":362.12,"text":"Hmm, maybe.","words":[["Hmm,",361.3,361.6],["maybe.",361.8,362.12]]},{"start":362.12,"end":366.88,"text":"Maybe. I suppose some manufacturers don't want to bore people with all the science.","words":[["Maybe.",362.12,362.26],["I",362.94,363.34],["suppose",363.34,363.6],["some",363.6,363.94],["manufacturers",363.94,364.6],["don't",364.6,365.0],["want",365.0,365.16],["to",365.16,365.24],["bore",365.24,365.5],["people",365.5,365.94],["with",365.94,366.2],["all",366.2,366.34],["the",366.34,366.46],["science.",366.46,366.88]]},{"start":367.44,"end":367.7,"text":"Sure.","words":[["Sure.",367.44,367.7]]},{"start":368.24,"end":371.0,"text":"And then there's the just go advertisement.","words":[["And",368.24,368.68],["then",368.68,368.96],["there's",368.96,369.56],["the",369.56,369.68],["just",369.68,369.98],["go",369.98,370.3],["advertisement.",370.3,371.0]]},{"start":371.48,"end":377.14,"text":"Yes. That had lots of technical information about what the shampoo actually consists","words":[["Yes.",371.48,371.96],["That",372.48,372.88],["had",372.88,373.22],["lots",373.22,373.56],["of",373.56,373.8],["technical",373.8,374.12],["information",374.12,374.92],["about",374.92,375.24],["what",375.24,375.46],["the",375.46,375.64],["shampoo",375.64,376.04],["actually",376.04,376.64],["consists",376.64,377.14]]},{"start":377.14,"end":383.9,"text":"of. I suppose they want customers to feel confident that when they buy just go, they are at","words":[["of.",377.14,377.68],["I",378.46,378.8],["suppose",378.8,379.16],["they",379.16,379.46],["want",379.46,379.66],["customers",379.66,380.08],["to",380.08,380.4],["feel",380.4,380.6],["confident",380.6,381.16],["that",381.16,381.74],["when",381.74,381.96],["they",381.96,382.18],["buy",382.18,382.54],["just",382.54,382.9],["go,",382.9,383.26],["they",383.52,383.68],["are",383.68,383.78],["at",383.78,383.9]]},{"start":383.9,"end":385.8,"text":"least making an informed decision.","words":[["least",383.9,384.08],["making",384.08,384.44],["an",384.44,384.68],["informed",384.68,385.14],["decision.",385.14,385.8]]},{"start":386.06,"end":389.58,"text":"Yes. They're buying something that will do the job they want it to.","words":[["Yes.",386.06,386.4],["They're",386.72,386.96],["buying",386.96,387.22],["something",387.22,387.64],["that",387.64,387.94],["will",387.94,388.06],["do",388.06,388.34],["the",388.34,388.48],["job",388.48,388.76],["they",388.76,388.96],["want",388.96,389.22],["it",389.22,389.38],["to.",389.38,389.58]]},{"start":389.88,"end":390.62,"text":"That's it.","words":[["That's",389.88,390.32],["it.",390.32,390.62]]},{"start":390.62,"end":390.72,"text":"What?","words":[["What?",390.62,390.72]]},{"start":391.14,"end":396.5,"text":"I've read one of the most effective shampoo ads in recent times was the one for brosene.","words":[["I've",391.14,391.72],["read",391.72,391.86],["one",391.86,392.06],["of",392.06,392.16],["the",392.16,392.24],["most",392.24,392.4],["effective",392.4,392.9],["shampoo",392.9,393.42],["ads",393.42,393.84],["in",393.84,394.04],["recent",394.04,394.38],["times",394.38,394.9],["was",394.9,395.36],["the",395.36,395.52],["one",395.52,395.68],["for",395.68,395.88],["brosene.",395.88,396.5]]},{"start":396.94,"end":403.06,"text":"Yes, but there's no commentary, just images of the shampoo and lots of clean hair.","words":[["Yes,",396.94,397.28],["but",397.48,397.62],["there's",397.62,397.9],["no",397.9,398.06],["commentary,",398.06,398.74],["just",399.3,399.46],["images",399.46,399.92],["of",399.92,400.28],["the",400.28,400.4],["shampoo",400.4,400.84],["and",400.84,401.68],["lots",401.68,402.0],["of",402.0,402.34],["clean",402.34,402.64],["hair.",402.64,403.06]]},{"start":404.3,"end":410.18,"text":"I suppose the effect though is very calming with soft music and very peaceful imagery.","words":[["I",404.3,404.62],["suppose",404.62,404.94],["the",404.94,405.22],["effect",405.22,405.62],["though",405.62,405.86],["is",405.86,406.04],["very",406.04,406.3],["calming",406.3,406.86],["with",406.86,407.54],["soft",407.54,407.94],["music",407.94,408.4],["and",408.4,409.02],["very",409.02,409.28],["peaceful",409.28,409.74],["imagery.",409.74,410.18]]},{"start":410.6,"end":414.98,"text":"Yes, but at the end of the ad, we've hardly learned anything about the product, have","words":[["Yes,",410.6,410.84],["but",410.96,411.1],["at",411.1,411.32],["the",411.32,411.44],["end",411.44,411.64],["of",411.64,411.8],["the",411.8,411.92]